Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guitar solo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.50,0:02:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just you and me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.70,0:03:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should at least try\Nto act like brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your whole life is a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed Rem! The crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You killed them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.53,0:03:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spectacular, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all die. Except,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.82,0:03:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of course, for the fraction who will\Nsurvive because of Rem's incessant meddling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no use staying here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.94,0:03:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or would you rather just lay there\Nand cry your little eyes out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.86,0:03:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a terrible environment,\Njust as I predicted it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:04:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be impossible for\Nany garbage to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.58,0:04:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can still work out\Nif they have the plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll survive by leeching\Noff the blood of our siblings,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gorging themselves like parasites.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hear the screams\Nof our brethren now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the anguished death cries of our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that why you kill people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kill spiders to save the butterflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.33,0:04:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed them. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one ever has the right\Nto take the life of another.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.36,0:05:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up, let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the true nature of these\Npathetic beasts known as humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all selfish, arrogant,\Ninsolent, grossly imperfect organisms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make me sick to my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that? What did you\Ndo? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you and i were born\Nwe had free will we're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.82,0:06:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no longer merely things\Nto be used by humans
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is he saying
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it damage isn't all that\Nbad it's usable what are you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,planning to do with this I have to\Ngo after something I left behind I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going to look for this might take a\Nlittle while I suggest to stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but nice it's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hard to be alone I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't want to be alone someone nice
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all done nice hey now where are you going
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a 13% output. That's the.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.48,0:07:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,best we can get what is that these
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are new siblings and this one will\Nbe yours we will use these guns
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to dispose of mankind I'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna do that yes you will never
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then why did you follow me and wait\Nuntil I returned because you're
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopeless on your own isn't that\Nright? Very well, watch me then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,15
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,years are you still
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so affected by that ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nonsense that fantasy world created\Nfor you by the woman who lived
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:08:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And died by contradiction. I won't\Nlet you kill any more people!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, dear brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you misunderstood me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're aiming at the wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all alive! Alive!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised Meryl that we would\Nmake this land... Exactly. We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I will make this\Nland into our very own Eden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.96,0:08:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My leg...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.90,0:08:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My leg, it hurts. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's so much pain in my leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you actually shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:08:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rem...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man is related to Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to tell him about Rem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Bash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now everything that joined you\Nand Rem together is finally gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that your excuse for killing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you learned anything\Nover the past hundred years?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scars they carved into your\Nbody will never regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.32,0:10:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Symbolic of your foolish waste\Nof energy on this human garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless of how you feel about\Nthem, they are living beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They deserve to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the use of growing\Nup if the only thing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that grows is your useless sentimentalism?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still a\Ngood-for-nothing pathetic whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.84,0:11:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our gift, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.62,0:11:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to take out this\Nworthless human garbage forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.90,0:11:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to shoot me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you actually gonna shoot me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.68,0:11:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make Vash suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make him suffer for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.24,0:11:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will, my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise the man belonging\Nto this arm will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's the end of Vash the Stampede!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and this town die together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had I been so inclined,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have killed you at\Nleast three times by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you kill them or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you are a noisy one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I did, chicken shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.31,0:12:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.44,0:12:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should never end this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What other alternative do I\Nhave if we're going to survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All lives are too different, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.80,0:13:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I failed to save someone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be more careful the next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's time to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.38,0:13:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The humans treat you well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.20,0:13:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you have fun, dear brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:13:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best thing that ever happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.14,0:14:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cancelled me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't create these weapons\Nto be wasted like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using them this way is the only thing\Nthat gives them any meaning at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless, isn't it?\NI've made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not a human being,\Nyou're a plant. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.02,0:17:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know that you're a\Nsuperior being I disagree
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong about this. Bash I\Nwon't make the same mistake twice
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hold me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.86,0:18:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.84,0:19:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Tito Noggin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.38,0:19:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use it, David!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're way! Oh! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,però! Jiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:19:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:21:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, I will survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.55,0:21:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weakest water! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash will come back. Won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.14,0:21:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't dare keep a\Ngood woman like me waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.77,0:21:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.76,0:22:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ram, I will continue to believe in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.04,0:22:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but from now on, I'll look\Nto my own words for Guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.52,0:22:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky under the sky,\Nthe wind is in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.52,0:22:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day of the sky, the light of the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.80,0:22:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the light
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.24,0:23:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.20,0:23:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.36,0:23:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave you in the next video.

